Package: i915-legacy-oled-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms, linux-source, linux-headers-amd64, patch, xz-utils, openssl,
 innoextract, python3, curl, ca-certificates
Description: i915 with brightness control for legacy OLED panels (DKMS)
 Rebuilds Debian's i915 with Chris Xiong's reverse engineered brightness
 control for the OLED panel of the ThinkPad X1 Yoga 1st and 2nd gen, from
 the linux-source package of each installed kernel's own version, and sets
 i915.enable_dpcd_backlight=99.
 .
 The panel data firmware the driver loads is not in this package: it is
 generated at installation from Lenovo's Windows panel driver package
 (n1ndp03w), which is downloaded from Lenovo and checked against its known
 SHA-256. Lenovo grants no license to redistribute it.
